        "label": "A",
        "text": "Maria is a doctor. She works in a big hospital in the city. She starts work at eight o'clock in the morning. She sees about twenty patients every day. She likes her job because she helps people, but sometimes she is very tired. Her friends say she is a kind and clever woman."
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "Pedro is a chef. He works in a restaurant near the station. He starts work at two o'clock in the afternoon and finishes at eleven at night. He cooks fish, chicken and pasta. His favourite dish is pasta with tomatoes. He does not like the weekends because the restaurant is very busy."
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "Anna is a teacher. She teaches English to children in a primary school. Her class has twenty-five students. They are seven years old. Anna likes her job because the children are funny. She has long holidays in July and August, and she often travels with her family."
      }
